<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45606" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφαπλ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spread</i> or <i>unfold over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄωτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					1336
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέων . . γυῖα γῆς ἐφαπλώσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					95.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῆθος ἐφαπλώσας . . ὄχθης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					15.9
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκτυα νεπόδεσσιν
			ἐ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				20.385
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρετμοῖς χεῖρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
				</span></i>
			
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A.</u>
				457
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὸ ἀγαθὸν διὰ τοῦ κόσμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					<u>in CA</u>
					21p.467M.
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἐμπροσθίους πόδας
				ἐφηπλῶσθαι ταῖς χερσί</span>
			<i>to have</i> the skin of the front feet <i>spread over</i> the
			hands, <i><span class="en">
				Longus
				1.20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκότος ἐφήπλωται</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.167a
			</span></i>.</div>
